{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c8c8f64f85686a34095c5da7cb4c249e8d7131e6dd7c22016cb950acc4280815",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_12:1_2_002_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a94dacb5fddc9504111e7a0bfed41cd7092285eb25fb1e572c0f63055956ddc",
      "text": "向两人撒娇索要的生日",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_12:1_2_002_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb02d0e5d7ede0039334011cb80730f92d27c47a6fc5f87028911a70f0e09b54",
      "text": "翔太向冬马和北斗提出请求，\n希望在自己的生日那天能吃到大餐。\n借用事务所的厨房，两人为满怀期待的翔太\n特意准备了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_12:1_2_002_12_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b9cbfcfc9776346b419d86ed26faa0fe05dbdacde144900d1c4a246e17e9387",
      "text": "辛苦了。冬马那边还顺利吗？我从常去的\n餐厅把单点菜品取回来了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_12:1_2_002_12_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5a323eb235545841ea48065b1d2d1290497ce2221de732bf101ee4dc7865f7f",
      "text": "哦。我这边剩下的装好盘也差不多搞定了。\n一大早就开始做还是踩着点才赶上……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_12:1_2_002_12_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1e6ba9bed27e93f3665d1d499bf0a285e5b8b621837246a7f51689eef4bb06a",
      "text": "不过每道都是自信之作。\n准备了这么多那家伙也该满足了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_12:1_2_002_12_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c104de9c8a2e359a1b7e31fd6ab8f0813bf22e774c63a603c52865e2e25bfb93",
      "text": "日式西式中式，涵盖了各种类别呢。\n翔太高兴的样子已经浮现在眼前了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_12:1_2_002_12_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c7f1991c7c26d50f3592c2a69feeae40b057d51f83f04d323e857be02772f46",
      "text": "啊啊，准没错的。听说他下次要在广播里\n聊感想，这下完全不用担心了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_12:1_2_002_12_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aec1965c6f343434ccba1eed0c7091257783ee86af8bf21c6f34121b020b27f4",
      "text": "呵呵，要是把菜全介绍一遍，\n感觉中途会被主持人叫停呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_12:1_2_002_12_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fe4cd08cab95b8f68fcdddc17b312d30d165ae630869989dfcba12f5210de48",
      "text": "仿“满汉全席”，每一道都超级好吃哦。\n下次还要做各种好吃的给我哦，冬马君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_12:1_2_002_12_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1daa85eb3f9aaf28553c514c52f5a3a330c4d79512b752944a2a676ca4b30bbe",
      "text": "我平时不是总变着花样给你做吗……\n算了，好吃就行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_12:1_2_002_12_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad16373a2d6fecc9327353dbae14d6cd113128d0b417d7e63c3fa74ef1ee104e",
      "text": "下次想尝尝正宗的呢。\n我在网上查过了，菜品数量好惊人啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_12:1_2_002_12_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfcb883254cf5eaea1924ea59b073fd26f0a653d8b75578a63cbf355518e7535",
      "text": "那个原本好像是要花好几天才能吃完的，\n不过我的话感觉1天就能搞定！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_12:1_2_002_12_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af2ec70f9897e30b5db1d510aa9e092f176d86a53c84893d37f8daa0d75b5df0",
      "text": "你是想用饭菜把事务所给淹没吗！？虽然以你\n的胃口说不定确实能转眼一扫而空就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_12:1_2_002_12_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5aec4a2be01c90874741e21cb49eec6335b70e12dee8623b9a8a25712ff5043a",
      "text": "今天拍到了好多好玩的画面呢～\n啊，也给北斗君发一份视频吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_12:1_2_002_12_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:240e93044ca8b81f477df35d1762e064a03f983202727dab703a15bd1dee48e0",
      "text": "冬马君那一脸严肃地往蛋糕上插蜡烛的\n样子，简直绝了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_12:1_2_002_12_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bb690247b0325c7434b19ede76e0b91b9bdf534af42c097d66c0e7764dc0a08",
      "text": "毕竟要小心翼翼不把蛋糕弄坏嘛。\n呵呵，那完全就是工匠的神情呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_12:1_2_002_12_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05bc1bb7edf10c4830ab10f819e1537d15f1574d80032bc3b4f901ef9600941d",
      "text": "对了，我这里也拍到了最佳镜头，稍后发给你。\n是翔太吃得津津有味的照片♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_12:1_2_002_12_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc56bd172820393ac2efae55024a2e1512a82e9338ef132fbe84ba8f30b0eb61",
      "text": "哎哎，北斗君什么时候拍了那种照片啊！？\n光顾着吃完全没注意到！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
